---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Capabilities — Fathom Autonomous AI Workers" description="Explore Fathom's autonomous worker capabilities: research, outreach, code, computer use, scheduling, memory, governance, and persistent operations.">
  <main class="fp-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="fp-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="featuresPivot.hero.badge">Autonomous worker capabilities</p>
        <h1 class="h2-sec" data-i18n-html data-i18n="featuresPivot.hero.title">One platform.<br /><em class="it">Every mission.</em></h1>
        <p class="copy-lg mx-auto" data-i18n="featuresPivot.hero.sub">Persistent workers turn plain-language goals into governed execution across research, code, computer use, outreach, and scheduled operations.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cap-grid">
        <a href="/features/research" class="cap-card">
          <span class="cap-icon">🔍</span>
          <h3 data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.research.title">Research &amp; analysis</h3>
          <p data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.research.desc">Search, fetch, parse, and synthesize cited findings with hierarchical workers that can fan out and reflect.</p>
          <span class="cap-go" data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.research.go">Explore research →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/tools" class="cap-card cap-card--accent">
          <span class="cap-icon">⌘</span>
          <h3 data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.computer.title">Code &amp; computer use</h3>
          <p data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.computer.desc">Workers can inspect repositories, run code, and operate a connected browser through explicit tool and approval boundaries.</p>
          <span class="cap-go" data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.computer.go">Explore tools →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/features/auto-outreach" class="cap-card">
          <span class="cap-icon">✉️</span>
          <h3 data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.outreach.title">Outreach &amp; operations</h3>
          <p data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.outreach.desc">Draft messages, sync approved records, schedule repeat runs, and notify your team when work is complete.</p>
          <span class="cap-go" data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.outreach.go">Explore operations →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/memory" class="cap-card">
          <span class="cap-icon">◌</span>
          <h3 data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.memory.title">Memory that persists</h3>
          <p data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.memory.desc">Append-only semantic memory and an entity graph keep workers grounded across sessions and repeat runs.</p>
          <span class="cap-go" data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.memory.go">Explore memory →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/security" class="cap-card">
          <span class="cap-icon">◎</span>
          <h3 data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.governance.title">Governance by default</h3>
          <p data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.governance.desc">Approval gates, policy hooks, secret scanning, and protected surfaces make side effects reviewable.</p>
          <span class="cap-go" data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.governance.go">Explore security →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/ops" class="cap-card">
          <span class="cap-icon">◷</span>
          <h3 data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.schedule.title">Scheduled workers</h3>
          <p data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.schedule.desc">Durable jobs and repeat mode let workers operate on a schedule and alert you when results change.</p>
          <span class="cap-go" data-i18n="featuresPivot.cap.schedule.go">Explore operations →</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="sec-head center">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="featuresPivot.fits.badge">How workers operate</p>
        <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="featuresPivot.fits.title">Goal to governed result.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="pipeline">
        {['Goal', 'Plan', 'Use tools', 'Reflect', 'Remember', 'Approve', 'Act', 'Notify'].map((s, i) => (
          <div class="pipe-step">
            <span class="pipe-num">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <span class="pipe-name" data-i18n={'featuresPivot.pipeline.' + i + '.name'}>{s}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="more-links">
        <a href="/tools" class="btn btn-secondary" data-i18n="featuresPivot.cta.tools">Browse all tools</a>
        <a href="/benchmarks" class="btn btn-secondary" data-i18n="featuresPivot.cta.benchmarks">See benchmarks</a>
        <a href="/#cta" class="btn btn-primary" data-i18n="featuresPivot.cta.start">Get started</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .fp-page { padding: 70px 0 90px; }
  .eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .16px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--grey-600); }
  .h3-sec { font-size: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 34px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 12px 0 16px; }
  .copy-lg { color: var(--grey-700); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 640px; }
  .mx-auto { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

  .fp-hero { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 48px; text-align: center; padding: 0 24px; }
  .fp-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 68px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.02; margin-top: 12px; }
  .fp-hero .copy-lg { margin-top: 20px; }

  .cap-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
  @media (max-width: 1100px) { .cap-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  .cap-card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; transition: box-shadow .25s var(--ease-out), transform .25s var(--ease-out), border-color .25s; }
  .cap-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--grey-400); }
  .cap-card--accent { border-color: var(--grey-300); }
  .cap-icon { font-size: 1.6rem; }
  .cap-card h3 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .cap-card p { color: var(--grey-600); font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.6; flex: 1; }
  .cap-go { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; color: var(--grey-900); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .cap-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .sec-head { max-width: 720px; margin: 64px auto 36px; }
  .sec-head.center { text-align: center; }

  .pipeline { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(8, 1fr); gap: 8px; }
  .pipe-step { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 16px 10px; text-align: center; transition: border-color .2s, box-shadow .2s; }
  .pipe-step:hover { border-color: var(--grey-400); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
  .pipe-num { display: block; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--grey-400); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .pipe-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .pipeline { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .pipeline { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }

  .more-links { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 40px; }
</style>
